	(descr "Littelfuse 470 Series thin-film chip fuse, 1206, 3.302 x 1.575 x 1.168mm, fast acting, 125V AC and 125V DC, interrupting 50A at 125VDC / 50A at 125VAC / 300A at 32VDC, -55 to +125C, epoxy resin body with Cu/Ni/Sn terminations, Pb-free and halogen-free. Manufacturer recommended land: 1.185 x 2.05mm pads on a 1.28mm gap, 3.65mm overall. Series land pattern - the rating is set by the order number, e.g. 0470.500DRSNP for 500mA with 0.5455 Ohm cold resistance and 0.0287 A2s nominal melting I2t")
